er="0"/><img src="http://s2.images.proboards.com/starred.gif" alt="*" border="0"/><br/>member is offline<br/><br/><center><br/><br/><br/></center><br/>Joined: Dec 2005<br/>Posts: 452<br/></td><td valign="top" align="left" bgcolor="000000" class="windowbg" width="80%" height="100%"><table width="100%" height="100%" border="0" cellpadding="2" cellspacing="2"	><tr><td align="left" valign="middle" width="5%"><img src="http://s2.images.proboards.com/xx.gif" alt=" " border="0"/></td><td align="left" valign="middle" width="55%"><font size="2"><b>Halcyon Raiding 101</b></font><br/><font size="1">&#171; Thread Started on Dec 7, 2005, 1:15pm &#187;</font></td><td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" width="40%"><font size="-1"></font></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" valign="top"><hr width="100%" size="1" class="hr"><font size="2">
