<b>Please note:</b> Special instructions are often given during the course of raids. Please pay attention and be aware of your surroundings! Focus is vital to the success of any given raid. AFKs should be limited! Please make your group member and class channel aware of any extended AFKs and ALWAYS, regardless of the length of your AFK, denote with a tag. <br/><br/>When leaving a raid, you <b>MUST</b> inform the raid leader (Ignatiuss) of your intent to do so! That can not be stressed enough! Upon informing him of your departure, be sure to ask if there are any further instructions necessary before you camp, especially if you are in an instanced zone! In instanced zones, you will likely need to either leave or stay in the expedition, depending on his instructions. 
